        "text": "The local demo adapter defaults to an OpenAI-compatible LLM endpoint at localhost port 8103 and allows an explicitly configured external LLM endpoint. The launcher runs mlx_lm.server with locally registered model files; the selected model identity comes from the local runtime metadata. The adapter adds source-bound persona-card observations and conditional decision notes, with bounded response length. This configuration does not establish that Qwen outperforms other models or prove the team's selection rationale."
